  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commonwealth Fund for Technical Cooperation (&#x201c;CFTC&#x201d;) is a fund to which Commonwealth member states make voluntary contributions that provide technical assistance in the form of professional advice, transfer of best practice and the enhancement of skills and knowledge in support of policy and institutional development, capacity building and specific projects and programmes for economic, social and political development in the Commonwealth</narrative>
